      "text": "EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT\nThis Employment Agreement (the \"Agreement\") is made on January 15, 2026 between Northwind Analytics Private Limited (the \"Company\") and Priya Sharma (the \"Employee\").\n1. Definitions\n1.2 \"Effective Date\" means February 1, 2026."
    },
    {
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. Term of Employment\n3.1 The term of this Agreement shall be two (2) years starting on the Effective Date.\n4. Probation\n4.1 During probation, either party may end the employment by giving fourteen (14) days written notice."
    },
    {
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "6. Salary and Payment\n6.1 The Company shall pay the Employee a gross salary of INR 1,20,000 per month."
    },
    {
      "page_number": 7,
      "text": "12. Termination\n12.1 Either party may terminate this Agreement by providing ninety (90) days written notice to the other party."
    }
